  FT["PH-H10491"] = {"id":"PH-H10491","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2024/ra_12103_2024.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立Marikina市","en":"An Act Declaring April 16 of Every Year A Special Nonworking Holiday in the City of Marikina, Amending For the Purpose Republic Act No. 10788, Entitled “An Act Declaring April 16 of Every Year A Special Holiday and No Class Day in Schools in the City of Marikina in Commemoration of Its Founding Anniversary To Be Known As ‘Marikina City Day’” </td> <td> ra2024/pdra_12103_2024.pdf","orig":"An Act Declaring April 16 of Every Year A Special Nonworking Holiday in the City of Marikina, Amending For the Purpose Republic Act No. 10788, Entitled “An Act Declaring April 16 of Every Year A Special Holiday and No Class Day in Schools in the City of Marikina in Commemoration of Its Founding Anniversary To Be Known As ‘Marikina City Day’” </td> <td> ra2024/pdra_12103_2024.pdf"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["education"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 12103","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2024-12-13","completenessNote":"全文，共 4 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2024/ra_12103_2024.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。 源文存在同号重出的条款（第 1 条）：该处官方页面确有两段均标同一 Section 号，本库照录其 `no` 值（不改动官方编号），条文 `id` 以 `_2`「_3」后缀保证唯一。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H10491-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Section 1 of Republic Act No. 10788 is hereby amended to read as follows:\n\""}},{"id":"PH-H10491-A1_2","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"April 16 of every year is hereby declared a special nonworking holiday in the City of Marikina in commemoration of its founding anniversary to be known as \"Marikina City Day\". If the day falls on a school day, classes at all levels in all schools in Marikina City shall be suspended.\""}},{"id":"PH-H10491-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Section 2 of the same Act is hereby repealed."}},{"id":"PH-H10491-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette or in a newspaper of general circulation."}}],"pack":"ph-p149"};
  FT["PH-H10492"] = {"id":"PH-H10492","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2024/ra_12104_2024.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立Guiguinto市","en":"An Act Declaring January 22 of Every Year A Special Working Holiday in the Municipality of Guiguinto, Province of Bulacan, in Celebration of the Halamanan Festival </td> <td> ra2024/pdra_12104_2024.pdf","orig":"An Act Declaring January 22 of Every Year A Special Working Holiday in the Municipality of Guiguinto, Province of Bulacan, in Celebration of the Halamanan Festival </td> <td> ra2024/pdra_12104_2024.pdf"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 12104","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2024-12-13","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2024/ra_12104_2024.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H10492-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"January 22 of every year is hereby declared a special working holiday in the Municipality of Guiguinto, Province of Bulacan, in celebration of the Halamanan Festival. Upon proclamation of the President, January of every year shall be a special non-working holiday in the Municipality of Guiguinto, Province of Bulacan."}},{"id":"PH-H10492-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette or in a newspaper of general circulation."}}],"pack":"ph-p149"};
  FT["PH-H10493"] = {"id":"PH-H10493","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2024/ra_12105_2024.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立Pavia市","en":"An Act Declaring January 8 of Every Year A Special Working Holiday in the Municipality of Pavia, Province of Iloilo, To Be Known As “Pavia Day”, To Commemorate Its Founding Anniversary </td> <td> ra2024/pdra_12105_2024.pdf","orig":"An Act Declaring January 8 of Every Year A Special Working Holiday in the Municipality of Pavia, Province of Iloilo, To Be Known As “Pavia Day”, To Commemorate Its Founding Anniversary </td> <td> ra2024/pdra_12105_2024.pdf"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 12105","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2024-12-13","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2024/ra_12105_2024.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H10493-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"January 8 of every year is hereby declared a special working holiday in the Municipality of Pavia, Province of Iloilo, to be known as \"Pavia Day\", to commemorate its founding anniversary. Upon proclamation of the President January 8 of every year shall be a special non-working holiday in the Municipality of Pavia, Province of Iloilo."}},{"id":"PH-H10493-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette or in a newspaper of general circulation."}}],"pack":"ph-p149"};
  FT["PH-H10494"] = {"id":"PH-H10494","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2024/ra_12106_2024.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":6,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立Liloy市","en":"An Act Establishing A Multi-species Marine Hatchery in the Municipality of Liloy, Province of Zamboanga Del Norte, and Appropriating Funds Therefor </td> <td> ra2024/pdra_12106_2024.pdf","orig":"An Act Establishing A Multi-species Marine Hatchery in the Municipality of Liloy, Province of Zamboanga Del Norte, and Appropriating Funds Therefor </td> <td> ra2024/pdra_12106_2024.pdf"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 12106","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2024-12-13","completenessNote":"全文，共 6 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2024/ra_12106_2024.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H10494-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"There shall be established, under the supervision of the Bureau of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources of the Department of Agriculture (DA-BFAR), a multi-species marine hatchery in the Municipality of Liloy, Province of Zamboanga del Norte."}},{"id":"PH-H10494-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Prior to the establishment of the multi-species marine hatchery, the DA-BFAR shall conduct a full-scale feasibility study in support of its construction to comply with the requirements of the Department of Budget and Management.\nWithin two (2) years after the construction of the multi-species marine hatchery, the DA-BFAR, through a memorandum of agreement, shall transfer its management to the local government of the Municipality of Liloy. It shall implement a training and phasing-in program for local government personnel on the management and operation of the hatchery."}},{"id":"PH-H10494-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"The DA-BFAR shall conduct continuing research and experimentation on the breeding and production of marine species, especially as they apply to local conditions, to discover new methods and technologies that will enhance the fishing industry."}},{"id":"PH-H10494-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"The Secretary of Agriculture shall include in the Department's programs the conduct of the feasibility study and consequent establishment of the multi-species marine hatchery in the Municipality of Liloy, Province of Zamboanga del Norte, the funding of which shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act. The local government unit concerned shall set aside funds from any available local revenue in an amount deemed appropriate for the operationalization of the hatchery."}},{"id":"PH-H10494-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"Within sixty (60) days from the effectivity of this Act, the Secretary of Agriculture shall issue the rules and regulations on the supervision, operation, monitoring, and the eventual transfer of the management of the multi-species hatchery to the local government of the Municipality of Liloy."}},{"id":"PH-H10494-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette or in a newspaper of general circulation."}}],"pack":"ph-p149"};
  FT["PH-H10495"] = {"id":"PH-H10495","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2024/ra_12107_2024.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立Baybay市","en":"An Act Establishing A Multi-species Marine Hatchery in the City of Baybay, Province of Leyte, and Appropriating Funds Therefor </td> <td> ra2024/pdra_12107_2024.pdf","orig":"An Act Establishing A Multi-species Marine Hatchery in the City of Baybay, Province of Leyte, and Appropriating Funds Therefor </td> <td> ra2024/pdra_12107_2024.pdf"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 12107","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2024-12-13","completenessNote":"全文，共 5 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2024/ra_12107_2024.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H10495-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"There shall be established, under the supervision of the Bureau of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources of the Department of Agriculture (DA-BFAR), a multi-species marine hatchery in the City of Baybay, Province of Leyte."}},{"id":"PH-H10495-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Prior to the establishment of the multi-species marine hatchery, the DA-BFAR shall conduct a full-scale feasibility study in support of its construction to comply with the requirements of the Department of Budget and Management.\nWithin two (2) years after the construction of the multi-species marine hatchery, the DA-BFAR, through a memorandum of agreement, shall transfer its management to the local government of the City of Baybay. It shall implement a training and phasing-in program for local government personnel on the management and operation of the hatchery."}},{"id":"PH-H10495-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"The Secretary of Agriculture shall include in the Department's programs the conduct of the feasibility study and the consequent establishment of a multi-species marine hatchery in the City of Baybay, Province of leyte, the funding of which shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act. The local government unit concerned shall set aside funds from any available local revenue in an amount deemed appropriate for the operationalization of the hatchery."}},{"id":"PH-H10495-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Within sixty (60) days from the effectivity of this Act, the Secretary of Agriculture shall issue the rules and regulations on the supervision, operation, monitoring, and the eventual transfer of the management of the multi-species marine hatchery to the local govenrment of the City of Baybay."}},{"id":"PH-H10495-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette or in a newspaper of general circulation."}}],"pack":"ph-p149"};
  FT["PH-H10496"] = {"id":"PH-H10496","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2024/ra_12108_2024.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立Lala市","en":"An Act Establishing A Coastal Aquaculture Center To Support and Rehabilitate the Bureau of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources Northern Mindanao Brackish Water Aquaculture Fish Farm in the Municipality of Lala, Province of Lanao Del Norte, and Appropriating Funds Therefor </td> <td> ra2024/pdra_12108_2024.pdf","orig":"An Act Establishing A Coastal Aquaculture Center To Support and Rehabilitate the Bureau of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources Northern Mindanao Brackish Water Aquaculture Fish Farm in the Municipality of Lala, Province of Lanao Del Norte, and Appropriating Funds Therefor </td> <td> ra2024/pdra_12108_2024.pdf"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["environment","culture"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 12108","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2024-12-13","completenessNote":"全文，共 5 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2024/ra_12108_2024.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H10496-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"There shall be established, under the supervision of the Bureau of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources of the Department of Agriculture (DA-BFAR), a coastal aquaculture center to further enhance the operations of the BFAR Northern Mindanao Brackish Water Aquaculture Fish Farm in the Municipality of Lala, Province of Lanao del Norte."}},{"id":"PH-H10496-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Prior to the establishment of the coastal aquaculture center, the DA-BFAR shall conduct a full-scale feasibility study in support of its construction to comply with the requirements of the Department of Budget and Management.\nThe DA-BFAR shall conduct continuing technological verification and experimentation on coastal aquaculture, especially as they apply to local conditions, and to discover new methods and technology that will rejuvenate the fishing industry."}},{"id":"PH-H10496-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"The Secretary of Agriculture shall include in the Department's programs the conduct of the feasibility study and the consequent establishment of the coastal aquaculture center, and the rehabilitation of the BFAR Northern Mindanao Brackish Water Aquaculture Fish Farm in the Municipality of Lala, Province of Lanao del Norte, the funding of which shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act."}},{"id":"PH-H10496-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Within sixty (60) days from the effectivity of this Act, the Secretary of Agriculture shall issue the rules and regulations on the supervision, operation, monitoring, and the eventual transfer of the management of the multi-species marine hatchery to the local govenrment of the City of Baybay."}},{"id":"PH-H10496-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette or in a newspaper of general circulation."}}],"pack":"ph-p149"};
  FT["PH-H10497"] = {"id":"PH-H10497","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2024/ra_12109_2024.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立Minalabac市","en":"An Act Establishing A Satellite Multi-species Marines Hatchery in the Municipality of Minalabac, Province of Camarines Sur, and Appropriating Funds Therefor </td> <td> ra2024/pdra_12109_2024.pdf","orig":"An Act Establishing A Satellite Multi-species Marines Hatchery in the Municipality of Minalabac, Province of Camarines Sur, and Appropriating Funds Therefor </td> <td> ra2024/pdra_12109_2024.pdf"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 12109","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2024-12-13","completenessNote":"全文，共 5 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2024/ra_12109_2024.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H10497-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"There shall be established, under the supervision of the Bureau of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources of the Department of Agriculture (DA-BFAR), a satellite multi-species marine hatchery in the Municipality of Minalabac, Province of Camarines Sur."}},{"id":"PH-H10497-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Prior to the establishment of the satellite multi-species marine hatchery, the DA-BFAR shall conduct a full-scale feasibility study in support of its construction to comply with the requirements of the Department of Budget and Management.\nWithin two (2) years after the construction of the satellite multi-species marine hatchery, the DA-BFAR, through a memorandum of agreement, shall transfer the management of the same to the local government of the Municipality of Minalabac. The DA-BFAR shall implement a training and phasing-in program for the local government personnel on the management and operation of the satellite multi-species marine hatchery."}},{"id":"PH-H10497-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"The Secretary of Agriculture shall include in the Department's programs the conduct of the feasibility study and the consequent establishment of the satellite multi-species marine hatchery in the Municipality of Minalabac, Province of Camarines Sur, the funding of which shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act. The local government unit concerned shall set aside funds from any available local revenue in an amount deemed appropriate for the operationalization of the satellite multi-species marine hatchery."}},{"id":"PH-H10497-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Within sixty (60) days from the effectivity of this Act, the Secretary of Agriculture shall issue the rules and regulations on the supervision, operation, monitoring, and the eventual transfer of the management of the multi-species marine hatchery to the local govenrment of the Municipality of Minalabac."}},{"id":"PH-H10497-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette or in a newspaper of general circulation."}}],"pack":"ph-p149"};
